    <p>
      <strong>The landing test:</strong> if you can plug in where you park at night,
      every other EV concern shrinks dramatically. If you cannot, you are signing
      up for a different lifestyle — and a PHEV or HEV may serve you better. This
      single fact decides more EV purchases than any spec sheet.
    </p>

    <h2>Dimension 2: Daily Driving Distance</h2>

    <p>
      Distance per day is the second filter. Most Malaysian families drive 30–60
      km per day (school, office, errands). A handful drive 100+ km daily. A
      small minority are below 20 km.
    </p>

